#lang rzk-1

-- A #data cannot be parametrised by a cube point, in any spelling: the
-- inline shape spelling is rejected on the surface form, and the bare-cube
-- and named-shape spellings are rejected on the elaborated sort, so the rule
-- does not depend on how the binder is written. Parameters of type CUBE or
-- I → TOPE range over cubes and shapes themselves and remain accepted (see
-- happy-data-shape-realisation).
#data P (t : 2) := c
